    "detailed_description": "Game Background<br />\r\nThis is an RPG simulation game<br />\r\nYou will become our protagonist - a conscious zombie<br />\r\nBecause they are infected with the zombie virus, once discovered, they will be killed by humans<br />\r\nSo in order to escape humanity<br />\r\nComing to an island alone<br />\r\nHowever, this island has many unknown dangers<br />\r\nSo can you survive on the island<br />\r\n-----<br />\r\nGame gameplay<br />\r\nAs a zombie, how do you learn to survive on your own?<br />\r\nYou must take care of yourself.<br />\r\nFor example,<br />\r\nConstruction: You must collect various materials to build your own hut<br />\r\nPlanting: Planting food to survive<br />\r\nFishing: Who says zombies cannot fish?<br />\r\nCombat: For your own survival, eliminate dangerous creatures on the island<br />\r\nMore dangers await you to experience",
